abstract: >-
  A health economics framework for evaluating AI-assisted clinical reasoning education as an investment in learner
  clinical-reasoning capital, institutional educational-process capital and shared digital-infrastructure capital,
  with a scenario simulator, notebooks for medicos and the evidence state of every reference.
